  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "7:16 P.M. \\ Clear\nLungmen Central Park, Finball Stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "text": "Your finballs.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Female Tourist",
      "text": "Oooh, such springy mouthfeel. Pretty good.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Female Tourist",
      "text": "This place definitely earned that recommendation in the Great Foodie Guide!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "text": "Glad you like it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Male Tourist",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Male Tourist",
      "text": "...That finball guy kinda gives me the creeps.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Female Tourist",
      "text": "I know what you mean. Like, you're selling finballs, why do you have a big knife on the counter there?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Male Tourist",
      "text": "The Foodie Guide says the owner is an old man called 'The Godly Finball Uncle.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Male Tourist",
      "text": "He couldn't be some kind of triad or something...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "text": "Hm? Did you want something else?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Female Tourist",
      "text": "Oh, no.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "text": "...customers have been so weird lately.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "I'm sure it's got nothing to do with that 'Resting Triad Face' you've got going on.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "text": "And this is what you wear to work? Think about how this makes Uncle Tung look.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "text": "Welcome back. Done with work?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "text": "You could say that. The office said you took some credit. How much?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "text": "32.60, rounded. You want to try one?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "text": "Where'd that come from? I don't have any change on me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "text": "Consider it a token of my appreciation for doing so much to look after my business.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "text": "All right. Don't mind if I do.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "text": "Hmm...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "text": "It's tasty and all, but isn't this Uncle Tung's stall? A tribute made with borrowed goods is one without meaning.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "text": "You always have to get your digs in. This one's on me...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "text": "Okay then. You've definitely gotten better. I wish the other punks took things as seriously as you do.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Evening. I'll take some finballs.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "text": "Coming right up.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Take your time. I'm just enjoying the view of the river. Usually don't see it from this far away.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Smells nice. The Great Foodie Guide never gets it wrong.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "text": "...order up. Here's your change.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Thanks.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "text": "Please come again.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "text": "Waai Fu? What are you looking at?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "text": "It's just that girl kinda weirded me out... do Sankta grow horns?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "text": "Must be some Sauin makeup or something.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "text": "They looked real. Whatever. Idle gossip is an unbecoming habit.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "text": "What's next on the agenda? Back to the office?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "text": "Studying. I've got a test in two days.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "text": "You're spending Sauin studying?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "text": "Sauin is supposed to be about shepherding spirits into the afterlife. Our society has totally corrupted it with consumerism. Respectfully, I will abstain.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "text": "Not to mention, I don't get paid that much. I need to get my grades up and nab a scholarship.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "text": "Yeah, that sounds about right for you...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "text": "It's their fault for being so out of touch. Don't lump me in with them.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Hm, I've still got some time. Where should I go next? Let's see, looks like there's some good eats around here...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Curious Lungmenite",
      "text": "Woah! What's happening up on the overpass? A car crash?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Strolling Lungmenite",
      "text": "Doesn't seem like a regular crash. Let's go check it out.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Easygoing Lungmenite",
      "text": "Another street fight? Count me in!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "text": "Friggin psychos, get away from meee!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Oh... so soon?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Looks like I'm on the clock already.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "Ow... I was thrown clear...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "text": "Thank heaven for guard rails. Otherwise we'd be a puddle down there.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "text": "Hurry up! Pull me out!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "They're trying to get away! Stay on them!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Mmmff! This... airbag... it's smooshing me!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "text": "Hold still! You're gonna crush my Lil Homie! Yo! Croissant! It's comin' outta your pay!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "text": "It ain't me! I can't move at all with Texas on top of me!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "Oof.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "Then I guess it's up to me——!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Bison! Wait!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "Everyone's crowding around. If they get away now we'll never catch them!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "text": "Pull me out already! That Forte kid's coming!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "text": "I'm trying!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "Don't move!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "So... heavy...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "Who——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "text": "A sniper?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "text": "Yo, Texas.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "On it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "(They missed. Bad shot?)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "(No, they're trying to hit the fuel tank——!)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "text": "Huh, what's going on? Who's shooting at the Forte kid?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "text": "Focus! The wolf's on her way too! Pull me out already!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "text": "Wait, what's that smell? It's fuel! Hurry!!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "text": "Brother... it's what it is.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "text": "You son of a——!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "Damn! I can't——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "Ugh. Too late.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
